    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nINVESTMENT OPPORTUNITY FOUR APARTMENTS WITH TENANTS IN SITU\n\nA well-established residential investment comprising four self-contained apartments, offering an attractive and diversified rental income stream.\n\nThis property presents an excellent opportunity for investors seeking an income-producing residential asset with multiple rental units under one ownership.\n\nThe property comprises:\n\nApartment 1: 2-Bedroom Apartment\nApartment 2: Studio Apartment\nApartment 3: 1-Bedroom Apartment\nApartment 4: 3-Bedroom Apartment\n\nThe varied mix of accommodation provides a broad tenant profile and a diversified rental offering. The property is being sold with tenants in situ, allowing an investor to acquire an established income-producing asset from completion, subject to the terms of the existing tenancies.\n\nKey Investment Features\nFour self-contained apartments within one investment\n2-bedroom, studio, 1-bedroom and 3-bedroom accommodation\nEstablished rental income\nTenants in situ\nDiversified rental income across multiple units\nIncome-producing residential investment from completion\nSuitable for investors seeking a multi-unit residential investment opportunity\n\nFurther information, including individual tenancy details, current rents and rental schedules, is available on request."
      },
      {
